{'symbol': 'AON', 'date': '2022-09-06 16:05:00', 'title': 'AON APPOINTS ADRIANA KARABOUTIS TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'DUBLIN , SEPT. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AON PLC (NYSE: AON), A LEADING GLOBAL PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ADRIANA KARABOUTIS, CHIEF INFORMATION AND DIGITAL OFFICER OF NATIONAL GRID PLC, HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS.'}